    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Drive your RC car through the circuit and try to finish as fast as possible! This is a time attack game in which you control an RC car and drive it on a circuit. You can change the settings of the RC car. The circuit is automatically generated by setting a 4-digit number (random string). -You can compete with your friends by sharing the random string."
